      "notes": "PCB pair with MX hot-swap sockets pre-installed, per-key RGB and USB-C between halves; needs case parts, switches and keycaps. 4x6 keys with vertical stagger plus up to 4 thumb keys per half (54 keys with 2u thumbs). Socket pin support is not stated. Keebio's own store blocked automated access, so the price is missing; Keebio now also lists Iris CE, LM and SE versions."
